WEBVTT

01:18.200 --> 01:21.830
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:22.090 --> 01:24.789
[Episode 31]

01:26.870 --> 01:29.190
Didn't you say it yourself
at the venture capital conference

01:29.190 --> 01:31.680
that rural revitalization
is a national strategy?

01:31.680 --> 01:33.650
This is definitely
a new wave of the times,

01:33.650 --> 01:34.200
right?

01:34.650 --> 01:35.880
And its impact

01:36.120 --> 01:37.509
is no less significant than

01:37.509 --> 01:39.350
the Reform and Opening-Up era
my father experienced decades ago.

01:39.350 --> 01:40.990
So sometimes I find myself thinking that

01:40.990 --> 01:41.870
it doesn't really matter

01:41.870 --> 01:43.200
whether Fulaxida

01:44.430 --> 01:45.759
ever makes money or not.

01:46.590 --> 01:48.080
Life is so short.

01:48.420 --> 01:49.900
If I run into a wave this big

01:49.920 --> 01:51.180
and don't even jump in,

01:51.390 --> 01:52.200
wouldn't that mean

01:52.200 --> 01:54.600
I've got less guts
than that old man of mine?

01:54.800 --> 01:55.440
True.

01:55.860 --> 01:57.640
And let me tell you something else.

01:57.640 --> 01:58.789
Whether a company

01:59.060 --> 02:00.540
can survive in the end

02:01.370 --> 02:03.700
doesn't depend on how much capital it has.

02:04.090 --> 02:05.420
Anyone can put up money.

02:05.510 --> 02:06.640
What really matters

02:06.750 --> 02:09.550
is the personal ability
of the project initiator.

02:10.310 --> 02:11.640
So what I value most

02:11.990 --> 02:13.050
is you, as a person.

02:15.090 --> 02:16.450
Of course, him too.

02:17.600 --> 02:18.320
2022.

02:19.370 --> 02:21.140
One at a time. One at a time.

02:22.390 --> 02:23.520
Because you two are like me—

02:23.520 --> 02:26.250
sharp enough to spot
the business opportunities

02:26.390 --> 02:29.700
of rural development
in such a restless city.

02:30.540 --> 02:32.579
And for that, I truly admire you.

02:35.210 --> 02:35.890
Yifei,

02:36.120 --> 02:36.920
how are you...

02:37.360 --> 02:39.020
so good at praising yourself?

02:39.510 --> 02:40.740
Teach me sometime, will you?

02:40.740 --> 02:42.700
See? I said you've got sharp instincts.

02:42.700 --> 02:44.010
But anyway,

02:44.090 --> 02:46.329
we're like-minded people,

02:47.510 --> 02:48.360
right?

02:49.160 --> 02:50.500
Look at this vast land.

02:51.320 --> 02:52.180
What is this?

02:52.920 --> 02:55.260
This is wealth bestowed by nature.

02:58.700 --> 02:59.960
But in my opinion,

03:00.120 --> 03:01.850
Fulaxida's strength right now

03:01.870 --> 03:03.270
is still far from enough.

03:03.380 --> 03:04.500
Still too slow.

03:05.140 --> 03:07.040
In the future, we must develop this place

03:07.040 --> 03:09.370
into a model zone for modern agriculture.

03:12.670 --> 03:14.200
You want to raise funds now?

03:14.460 --> 03:16.060
Didn't you disagree before?

03:16.960 --> 03:19.490
What I disagreed with
was raising dumb money.

03:19.650 --> 03:20.390
Because that kind of money is

03:20.390 --> 03:22.370
as good as burned—
it won't leave you with anything real,

03:22.370 --> 03:23.260
you understand?

03:23.260 --> 03:25.150
What we really need

03:25.670 --> 03:26.780
is smart money—capital that comes

03:26.780 --> 03:29.180
with valuable resources and connections.

03:29.300 --> 03:30.810
That's the kind of money I want.

03:30.810 --> 03:32.210
And the more, the better.

03:32.730 --> 03:34.340
Only that kind of capital

03:34.370 --> 03:36.660
can turn this dream into reality.

03:38.760 --> 03:39.390
I get it.

03:40.040 --> 03:42.240
We're going after the right investors.

03:52.350 --> 03:52.950
Exactly.

03:53.130 --> 03:54.560
That's what Yifei said.

03:54.590 --> 03:55.810
He's agreed to raise funding.

03:55.810 --> 03:57.670
It really wasn't easy

03:57.860 --> 03:59.400
to get Mr. Li to budge.

04:00.080 --> 04:01.540
Isn't it just smart money?

04:01.840 --> 04:03.440
I'll go prepare it now.

04:03.750 --> 04:04.280
Okay.

04:10.050 --> 04:18.410
[Sanglin Group Co., Ltd.]

04:17.310 --> 04:18.010
Alright.

04:19.010 --> 04:20.670
Now the big problem is solved.

04:21.940 --> 04:23.980
Once Fulaxida goes public
through a reverse merger,

04:23.980 --> 04:26.040
the shares I'm holding on your behalf

04:26.970 --> 04:28.700
will multiply dozens of times.

04:29.660 --> 04:31.790
But only if I'm still alive to claim it.

04:31.910 --> 04:33.840
The situation isn't looking good.

04:34.650 --> 04:36.460
I think we need to speed things up

04:37.230 --> 04:39.430
before something unexpected happens.

04:39.970 --> 04:41.630
I've done my best with my part.

04:42.350 --> 04:43.480
The rest is up to you.

04:44.460 --> 04:45.240
Don't worry.

04:46.350 --> 04:48.190
We've been friends for decades.

04:49.700 --> 04:50.760
Just leave it to me.

04:51.770 --> 04:52.230
Come on,

04:52.840 --> 04:53.550
have some water.

04:53.550 --> 04:55.659
[Sanglin Group Co., Ltd.]

04:56.550 --> 04:58.150
I know how you handle things.

04:59.280 --> 05:00.350
But sometimes,

05:00.620 --> 05:02.400
things just don't go as planned.

05:02.400 --> 05:04.600
Better to be cautious, don't you think?

05:20.870 --> 05:21.800
Is it connected?

05:21.800 --> 05:22.620
Yes!

05:22.650 --> 05:23.560
Is it working?

05:23.620 --> 05:24.380
Yes!

05:40.180 --> 05:43.190
You know, you look just like
a lovesick teenager.

05:44.730 --> 05:46.110
Where's that fire you had

05:46.110 --> 05:47.600
when you were winning over

05:47.600 --> 05:48.460
the villagers?

05:48.640 --> 05:50.040
Pull yourself together.

05:52.560 --> 05:53.710
It's all work.

05:59.640 --> 06:01.070
My wife called me.

06:02.080 --> 06:04.790
Qian Fei didn't even know
you'd come here on a business trip.

06:04.790 --> 06:06.920
What's going on? Trouble in paradise?

06:09.110 --> 06:09.840
Nothing.

06:10.160 --> 06:11.020
Nothing at all.

06:15.170 --> 06:15.610
I see.

06:16.280 --> 06:17.280
Off to a bad start.

06:18.920 --> 06:20.360
What nonsense are you talking about?

06:20.360 --> 06:21.290
What do you know?

06:23.960 --> 06:24.820
Let me tell you,

06:25.720 --> 06:28.080
I used to be just like you.

06:28.560 --> 06:29.880
Before, with my wife,

06:29.910 --> 06:31.500
I used to just keep everything in my head—

06:31.500 --> 06:33.860
thinking it over, imagining things,

06:33.890 --> 06:35.570
blah blah blah, and all that.

06:36.010 --> 06:38.140
But I forgot the most important thing—

06:38.960 --> 06:39.670
feeling.

06:40.770 --> 06:43.570
As long as it feels right,
that's all that matters.

06:44.550 --> 06:45.159
I know.

06:45.250 --> 06:47.170
You finance guys always like

06:47.190 --> 06:49.630
calculating your returns and losses,

06:49.659 --> 06:51.720
and planning for every contingency.

06:52.260 --> 06:54.670
But love isn't rational.

06:54.690 --> 06:55.960
It's emotional.

06:56.720 --> 06:57.980
And I'll tell you this—

06:58.220 --> 06:59.620
if fate has already planned a relationship

06:59.620 --> 07:00.650
for the two of you,

07:00.970 --> 07:02.390
then as long as your paths cross,

07:02.390 --> 07:03.500
there's no escaping it.

07:03.500 --> 07:06.760
Running all the way out here
still won't make a difference.

07:09.750 --> 07:11.080
So, Mr. Li,

07:12.080 --> 07:14.790
you're just
making things harder on yourself.

07:18.230 --> 07:19.330
Keep an eye on things here.

07:19.330 --> 07:20.990
I'll go take a look over there.

07:36.480 --> 07:43.270
♪ What matters to me is what you need ♪

07:44.470 --> 07:50.730
♪ Nothing more, nothing less,
I just hope it's something I can give ♪

07:48.080 --> 07:49.380
Why is it you?

07:51.450 --> 07:57.760
♪ What I cherish is what I have ♪

07:59.270 --> 08:04.930
♪ Every little moment,
I hope you're there with me ♪

08:06.130 --> 08:09.880
♪ Those fairy tales, sweet words,
and declarations of love ♪

08:11.730 --> 08:13.880
♪ Are like fireworks
lighting up the night ♪

08:13.040 --> 08:15.160
Cut it out! Let's fulfill the contract.

08:14.340 --> 08:18.540
♪ Truths, lies,
and words said just for show ♪

08:17.360 --> 08:18.620
Fulfill the contract.

08:19.320 --> 08:21.040
♪ Feel like I'm walking on cotton ♪

08:21.470 --> 08:25.650
♪ Harsh words, lies,
and words I can't make sense of ♪

08:26.330 --> 08:28.320
♪ Pretentious words wrapped
in glitter and glamour ♪

08:28.550 --> 08:32.909
♪ Dreams, madness,
and the words buried in my heart ♪

08:33.470 --> 08:37.480
♪ Under your fiery eyes ♪

08:53.060 --> 08:59.930
♪ What I dream of is being with you ♪

09:00.670 --> 09:06.770
♪ Hand in hand,
taking life at an easy pace ♪

09:07.430 --> 09:13.760
♪ What I wish for
is something that lasts ♪

09:15.290 --> 09:21.220
♪ Day by day, holding you close
in a life that's simple and true ♪

09:22.120 --> 09:26.160
♪ Those fairy tales, sweet words,
and declarations of love ♪

09:26.660 --> 09:30.150
♪ Are like fireworks
lighting up the night ♪

09:30.840 --> 09:34.660
♪ Truths, lies,
and words said just for show ♪

09:35.780 --> 09:37.200
♪ Feel like I'm walking on cotton ♪

09:37.970 --> 09:41.790
♪ Harsh words, lies,
and words I can't make sense of ♪

09:42.830 --> 09:44.520
♪ Pretentious words wrapped
in glitter and glamour ♪

09:45.050 --> 09:48.960
♪ Dreams, madness,
and the words buried in my heart ♪

09:49.970 --> 09:53.660
♪ Under your fiery eyes ♪

10:00.220 --> 10:03.750
♪ Those fairy tales, sweet words,
and declarations of love ♪

10:05.190 --> 10:08.040
♪ Are like fireworks
lighting up the night ♪

10:08.700 --> 10:14.650
♪ Dreams, madness,
and the words buried in my heart ♪

10:20.130 --> 10:20.860
[Online Q&A]

10:21.100 --> 10:21.880
I used

10:21.200 --> 10:23.610
[Fulaxida, well done]

10:21.880 --> 10:23.760
a small camera like this,

10:23.830 --> 10:26.160
so experts could remotely guide him

10:26.180 --> 10:28.400
in treating his son, over several months.

10:28.400 --> 10:29.950
The results were excellent!

10:29.950 --> 10:32.840
They're currently in Shanghai
for a follow-up visit

10:32.840 --> 10:34.440
and will be back in a few days.

10:35.360 --> 10:38.450
-How is that not the same thing?
-It's only been a few days,

10:38.450 --> 10:39.730
-but you've lost weight.
-His son, Xin Ba,

10:39.730 --> 10:41.320
could receive treatment and guidance

10:41.320 --> 10:44.650
from international medical experts
in such a remote place—

10:45.040 --> 10:46.440
what made that possible?

10:48.590 --> 10:50.990
[Xin You]

10:52.880 --> 10:54.120
Xin You,

10:54.400 --> 10:55.640
it's me, Qian Fei.

10:56.660 --> 10:58.990
I just came across a short video
about you.

10:59.070 --> 11:00.600
How are you and Xin Ba doing?

11:51.680 --> 11:53.020
Hello, Xin You.

11:54.310 --> 11:56.520
You saw my message, right?

11:59.810 --> 12:01.930
You're in Shanghai now?

12:02.970 --> 12:04.430
I'm free. Yes, I'm free.

12:05.470 --> 12:07.270
Okay, let's meet tomorrow then.

12:08.400 --> 12:09.730
Okay, see you tomorrow.

12:30.840 --> 12:31.990
I'm so sorry

12:32.100 --> 12:34.700
you had to stay
and play with  my son for so long.

12:34.830 --> 12:35.830
Not at all.

12:35.830 --> 12:37.310
Seeing how well
he's responding to the treatment,

12:37.310 --> 12:38.570
I couldn't be happier.

12:39.740 --> 12:40.880
We should thank Yifei.

12:40.880 --> 12:41.740
After you left,

12:41.790 --> 12:44.550
specialists continued
treating Xin Ba online.

12:44.570 --> 12:47.710
This trip here is for him
to meet the specialists in person.

12:47.710 --> 12:50.300
They said
Xin Ba's social communication skills

12:50.300 --> 12:51.300
have improved

12:51.430 --> 12:53.410
and are now on par with kids his age.

12:53.520 --> 12:54.580
That's wonderful.

12:54.590 --> 12:55.240
That means

12:55.240 --> 12:57.140
he can make more friends from now on.

12:57.140 --> 12:58.550
I remember he and Ji

12:58.550 --> 13:00.600
had a falling out once.

13:00.820 --> 13:01.380
Yes.

13:01.660 --> 13:03.320
And there's even better news.

13:04.060 --> 13:05.780
Yifei's company, Fulaxida,

13:05.880 --> 13:07.100
has chosen our county

13:07.120 --> 13:09.060
as the site for its pilot farm.

13:09.090 --> 13:10.440
It's boosted the economy

13:10.440 --> 13:11.640
of our entire county.

13:11.950 --> 13:12.980
Next time you come,

13:12.980 --> 13:14.680
you won't have to worry about
your car breaking down

13:14.680 --> 13:15.890
on those remote mountain roads—

13:15.890 --> 13:18.280
there are logistics trucks
coming and going every day now.

13:18.280 --> 13:21.120
Fulaxida is Li Yifei's company?

13:21.980 --> 13:24.030
Well, it's just a side venture for him.

13:24.030 --> 13:24.880
But

13:24.940 --> 13:27.950
he must be a major shareholder
of Fulaxida.

13:32.180 --> 13:32.650
Look.

13:33.630 --> 13:34.680
This was taken before we left.

13:34.680 --> 13:37.080
Yifei brought
his new technology consultants

13:37.080 --> 13:37.940
to our village.

13:38.650 --> 13:41.100
He said they were going to
develop some kind of livestream app

13:41.100 --> 13:43.460
for cattle, sheep, and so on.

13:43.490 --> 13:45.290
It sounded pretty interesting.

13:46.670 --> 13:49.120
I heard Yifei's company
has a technical partnership

13:49.120 --> 13:50.360
with Mr. Lu's company.

13:50.360 --> 13:51.740
That way, consumers

13:51.760 --> 13:53.470
can log into the app directly

13:53.500 --> 13:56.500
to check the agricultural products
they've ordered—

13:57.190 --> 13:57.890
from the moment of

13:57.890 --> 14:00.640
planting or birth,
through every stage of growth,

14:00.640 --> 14:02.570
all the way to their dining table.

14:02.630 --> 14:03.890
Isn't that wonderful?

14:04.040 --> 14:05.570
He's so business-savvy.

14:05.940 --> 14:08.020
My God. He's done so much all this time

14:08.050 --> 14:09.450
without me even knowing.

14:10.700 --> 14:11.890
In the same amount of time,

14:11.890 --> 14:13.210
with all my effort,

14:13.240 --> 14:15.120
I only went from one to ten,

14:15.200 --> 14:17.180
while he went from ten to fifty.

14:17.210 --> 14:18.420
Looking at it that way,

14:18.420 --> 14:19.750
you should be proud too.

14:20.200 --> 14:21.610
In the same amount of time,

14:21.610 --> 14:22.950
you improved tenfold,

14:22.990 --> 14:24.720
and he only improved fivefold.

14:25.430 --> 14:26.260
As for my son,

14:26.710 --> 14:28.950
he went from zero to one.

14:28.970 --> 14:30.250
Even that small step

14:30.620 --> 14:32.960
already feels like a great miracle to me.

14:32.990 --> 14:34.140
Fei!

14:34.350 --> 14:34.800
Xin Ba.

14:34.820 --> 14:35.310
Xin Ba.

14:35.440 --> 14:36.050
I'm happy.

14:36.160 --> 14:37.760
-Happy?
-Say goodbye to Fei.

14:37.870 --> 14:38.890
We're going back.

14:39.370 --> 14:40.640
You're leaving already?

14:40.640 --> 14:42.010
He has to get back to school.

14:42.010 --> 14:43.660
Our flight is tonight.

14:43.990 --> 14:44.840
And we hope

14:45.590 --> 14:47.200
you'll come visit us sometime.

14:47.200 --> 14:47.930
Definitely.

14:48.240 --> 14:49.470
I'll see you off.

14:49.860 --> 14:50.220
Okay.

14:59.170 --> 14:59.650
[Anti-Scam Center Alert: If you
receive messages on short video platforms]

14:59.680 --> 15:00.150
[or instant messaging apps like iMessage
from someone claiming to be a leader,]

15:00.180 --> 15:00.470
[or a contact who says they've changed
their phone number, please stay alert.]

15:00.490 --> 15:00.880
[Verify their identity immediately
to avoid fraud.]

15:04.880 --> 15:08.010
It's been so many days,
and he hasn't contacted me at all.

15:30.260 --> 15:32.400
[Pretentious Li]

15:40.880 --> 15:41.050
[WeChat]

15:42.040 --> 15:45.010
[Another fruitful day]

15:57.650 --> 15:59.070
It feels like everyone

15:59.710 --> 16:01.240
is revolving around you,

16:02.920 --> 16:03.890
except me.

16:05.870 --> 16:08.130
Like I'm the one being kept at a distance.

16:46.170 --> 16:47.410
Hello.

16:48.400 --> 16:48.950
Honey!

16:52.410 --> 16:54.210
You look so silly, but handsome.

16:54.290 --> 16:57.100
[Microphone On] [Speaker On] [Camera On]

16:54.560 --> 16:55.400
You're the silly one.

16:55.400 --> 16:57.600
I came to the greenhouse
to adjust the equipment.

16:57.600 --> 16:58.660
So you missed me?

16:59.750 --> 17:00.880
I missed you so much.

17:02.650 --> 17:04.180
Let me tell you some gossip.

17:04.190 --> 17:04.950
What is it?

17:05.369 --> 17:06.130
Li Yifei

17:06.990 --> 17:07.839
came all the way here,

17:07.839 --> 17:09.510
and he's been completely lovesick
over Qian Fei.

17:09.510 --> 17:11.240
But he doesn't even realize it.

17:13.329 --> 17:14.859
So that's how it is.

17:15.770 --> 17:16.950
I'm about to meet up with Fei.

17:16.950 --> 17:18.319
Should I tell her?

17:17.579 --> 17:21.119
[Microphone On] [Speaker On] [Camera On]

17:18.750 --> 17:19.599
No, no, no.

17:20.030 --> 17:21.560
Don't get involved in this.

17:21.760 --> 17:23.319
Just let things happen naturally
between them.

17:23.319 --> 17:26.780
If outsiders get involved,
it'll put a lot of pressure on them.

17:27.099 --> 17:28.140
Alright then.

17:28.840 --> 17:30.320
Trust me, I'm right.

17:31.270 --> 17:32.470
Okay, I'm hanging up.

17:38.940 --> 17:42.740
So I had to put down my phone every day,

17:43.920 --> 17:45.350
cook alone,

17:46.470 --> 17:48.560
check job listings alone,

17:49.510 --> 17:51.160
do chores alone,

17:51.750 --> 17:54.120
and say goodnight to the wall.

17:56.080 --> 17:57.710
Then you felt lonely

17:57.730 --> 17:59.120
and asked me out.

18:04.930 --> 18:06.220
Actually...

18:09.490 --> 18:11.140
You two are really interesting.

18:11.140 --> 18:11.820
You...

18:13.640 --> 18:14.190
He...

18:14.470 --> 18:16.030
Me, him, me, him... Come on.

18:16.080 --> 18:18.010
Can you just finish your sentence?

18:18.060 --> 18:20.480
Don't you think you're acting like

18:21.270 --> 18:22.030
someone who's either in love

18:22.030 --> 18:23.960
or has just had their heart broken?

18:25.190 --> 18:26.330
Why do you say that?

18:27.690 --> 18:30.030
Because I'm picking up a different

18:30.060 --> 18:32.260
vibe from you.

18:32.750 --> 18:34.570
What are you, a dog?

18:36.660 --> 18:39.110
I just feel so embarrassed.

18:39.600 --> 18:40.510
I thought

18:40.990 --> 18:43.420
that kiss between us was just a dream.

18:44.080 --> 18:45.580
Now he's avoiding me,

18:45.980 --> 18:49.510
using a business trip as an excuse
to run as far away as possible.

18:49.720 --> 18:51.510
How am I supposed to get out of

18:52.080 --> 18:53.610
such an awkward situation?

18:54.760 --> 18:55.590
Fei,

18:56.230 --> 18:57.180
honestly,

18:57.490 --> 18:59.120
I'm certain you like him.

19:03.890 --> 19:05.490
I've never thought about it.

19:06.320 --> 19:07.650
Never thought about it?

19:07.950 --> 19:08.810
What about now?

19:10.960 --> 19:11.960
Let me think then.

19:15.860 --> 19:18.590
I wouldn't exactly call it "liking" him.

19:19.060 --> 19:20.210
It's just that...

19:21.030 --> 19:23.010
it's pretty boring without him around.

19:23.010 --> 19:25.610
Maybe I've just gotten used to
cooking for him.

19:26.750 --> 19:27.510
Okay then.

19:28.810 --> 19:30.940
Let me help you sort out your thoughts.

19:31.710 --> 19:34.070
Let's set aside
whether you like him or not for now.

19:34.070 --> 19:35.910
First, you have to admit

19:36.200 --> 19:38.440
that he's not from the same world as us.

19:39.250 --> 19:41.240
Look at what he eats, wears,
and plays with—

19:41.240 --> 19:42.770
none of it's in your league.

19:42.790 --> 19:45.280
Then what league is he in,
and what league am I in?

19:45.280 --> 19:45.910
You?

19:45.940 --> 19:47.180
Needless to say,

19:47.200 --> 19:49.270
you're in the grassroots league.

19:50.760 --> 19:51.840
But him?

19:52.150 --> 19:54.060
He runs in the rich,
handsome, elite league.

19:54.060 --> 19:56.730
People like him
have countless ways to make money.

19:56.730 --> 19:57.770
Lu Ze told me

19:57.800 --> 19:59.320
that Li Yifei invested a huge amount

19:59.320 --> 20:00.580
in Fulaxida.

20:01.070 --> 20:02.540
He sold his house.

20:02.660 --> 20:04.080
Went all in.

20:04.160 --> 20:06.490
Tens of millions invested just like that.

20:06.920 --> 20:08.610
I heard

20:08.820 --> 20:11.350
that the house was
actually bought by his dad.

20:12.000 --> 20:13.990
Later, the house appreciated in value,

20:13.990 --> 20:15.670
so he sold it

20:15.950 --> 20:17.280
and invested the money.

20:17.340 --> 20:20.800
Now, isn't he so broke that he has to
share an apartment with me?

20:21.300 --> 20:22.450
Let's not talk about him anymore.

20:22.450 --> 20:24.090
Let's talk about your Lu Ze.

20:24.390 --> 20:27.040
He suddenly switched careers
to go into agriculture.

20:27.040 --> 20:29.800
How did you manage to
talk yourself into supporting him?

20:29.800 --> 20:30.560
Qian Fei,

20:31.060 --> 20:32.730
can you focus a bit?

20:32.760 --> 20:34.710
Where's your attention
wandering off to now?

20:34.710 --> 20:36.190
I'm talking to you about Li Yifei,

20:36.190 --> 20:38.920
and now you're bringing up
Lu Ze and agriculture?

20:39.810 --> 20:42.010
Haven't you noticed you always do this?

20:42.090 --> 20:44.620
Whenever the conversation gets to
what you really care about,

20:44.620 --> 20:45.950
you change the subject.

20:58.710 --> 21:00.970
I don't know what's going on with you two.

21:01.030 --> 21:01.950
Anyway, I think

21:01.950 --> 21:03.450
you should just take it one step at a time

21:03.450 --> 21:05.180
and leave everything to time.

21:06.530 --> 21:07.530
Wait and see.

21:08.940 --> 21:09.820
I'll listen to you.

21:09.820 --> 21:12.280
Wait and see,
and let nature take its course.

21:13.180 --> 21:13.780
Thank you.

21:17.060 --> 21:19.180
Oh, right.
Our class monitor called and said

21:19.180 --> 21:21.920
Saturday is
the fifth-anniversary class reunion.

21:21.920 --> 21:22.900
Our student affairs counselor
will be there too.

21:22.900 --> 21:24.150
He asked whether everyone could make it.

21:24.150 --> 21:26.280
No problem. I'll definitely be there.

21:27.490 --> 21:29.970
But I think
he must have also called Wang Ruohai.

21:29.970 --> 21:32.430
If he goes too, will you...

21:33.060 --> 21:35.100
Will I what? Of course I won't.

21:35.130 --> 21:36.270
I worked with him at Shanlifang

21:36.270 --> 21:37.380
for quite some time.

21:37.380 --> 21:38.100
You forgot?

21:39.430 --> 21:40.240
That's good.

21:40.270 --> 21:42.430
Anyway, I'll be out of town that day,

21:42.450 --> 21:44.020
so I won't make a special trip back.

21:44.020 --> 21:45.800
Say hello to everyone for me.

21:46.880 --> 21:47.880
You're not going?

21:48.560 --> 21:49.050
Then...

21:49.600 --> 21:50.380
If you're not going,

21:50.380 --> 21:51.830
won't I be alone?

21:51.860 --> 21:54.340
Dealing with Wang Ruohai all by myself?

21:54.990 --> 21:56.920
Why would you have to deal with him?

21:57.440 --> 21:58.230
Listen,

21:58.810 --> 22:00.740
if he tries to get close to you,

22:00.760 --> 22:01.840
it's easy to handle.

22:01.840 --> 22:03.500
Just slap him across the face.

22:05.540 --> 22:06.800
Problem solved.

22:06.920 --> 22:09.020
Your project is really good.

22:09.840 --> 22:12.080
Nowadays, young people in the villages
have all gone out to work.

22:12.080 --> 22:13.280
In our village alone,

22:13.480 --> 22:14.320
there's

22:14.490 --> 22:16.470
a huge amount of farmland lying idle.

22:16.470 --> 22:17.880
If you can use it

22:17.900 --> 22:20.390
for pilot fields
and agricultural development,

22:20.390 --> 22:21.760
helping farmers increase their income,

22:21.760 --> 22:23.860
that would truly be a tremendous service
to the community.

22:23.860 --> 22:25.150
Village Chief, rest assured.

22:25.150 --> 22:26.910
The whole purpose of this project

22:26.910 --> 22:29.640
is to increase
the overall income of the farmers.

22:30.250 --> 22:31.330
I believe that.

22:31.530 --> 22:32.220
How is it?

22:34.040 --> 22:34.990
It's Mr. Sang.

22:37.430 --> 22:39.590
Look, those plots over there
and over there.

22:39.590 --> 22:41.700
They need a bit more water
and are very fertile.

22:41.700 --> 22:42.260
Yes.

22:42.280 --> 22:43.520
It's all excellent farmland.

22:43.520 --> 22:43.940
Yes.

22:54.340 --> 22:56.540
Yifei, I really have to push you on this.

22:56.920 --> 22:59.050
The farmers out there are all waiting.

23:01.360 --> 23:02.960
You mean the financing, right?

23:02.960 --> 23:03.630
Yes.

23:04.270 --> 23:05.800
Didn't you say a few days ago

23:06.110 --> 23:08.370
that we should start further financing?

23:08.860 --> 23:09.870
Are you now...

23:09.950 --> 23:10.600
Ma Li,

23:11.040 --> 23:13.570
I still think
it's too early to raise funding.

23:13.990 --> 23:14.620
No, Yifei.

23:17.980 --> 23:19.160
What do you mean?

23:19.710 --> 23:21.080
You keep flip-flopping—

23:21.080 --> 23:22.450
saying yes to financing one moment
and no the next.

23:22.450 --> 23:24.180
What are you thinking exactly?

23:25.700 --> 23:27.430
The person you met with a few days ago

23:27.430 --> 23:28.590
was Mr. Sang, wasn't it?

23:28.590 --> 23:29.080
Yeah.

23:29.640 --> 23:30.900
Was there anyone else?

23:31.240 --> 23:32.530
And Mr. Liao Jinshan.

23:33.630 --> 23:35.410
Li Yifei, just say what you want to say.

23:35.410 --> 23:37.640
Why does this feel like an interrogation?

23:37.640 --> 23:39.230
Don't meet with Mr. Sang anymore.

23:39.230 --> 23:41.160
You can't tell who's trustworthy.

23:41.920 --> 23:43.360
You're going too far.

23:43.380 --> 23:45.130
Wasn't Mr. Sang introduced to us

23:45.130 --> 23:45.910
through your connections?

23:45.910 --> 23:46.920
If you're denying him now,

23:46.920 --> 23:47.990
you're denying yourself.

23:47.990 --> 23:49.850
I admit I misjudged him this time.

23:54.540 --> 23:56.670
But this time, I'm absolutely certain

23:57.350 --> 23:59.840
that Mr. Sang approached Fulaxida
with an agenda

23:59.840 --> 24:01.240
from the very beginning.

24:03.830 --> 24:05.510
I don't know why you say that.

24:05.650 --> 24:08.080
Maybe you have
your own reasons and judgment.

24:08.080 --> 24:09.410
But what I want to say is,

24:09.850 --> 24:11.240
no matter what you've heard,

24:11.240 --> 24:12.470
when the farmers caused trouble
a few days ago,

24:12.470 --> 24:13.580
if it hadn't been for Mr. Sang,

24:13.580 --> 24:15.100
you and your silver tongue alone

24:15.100 --> 24:15.980
might not have been enough to handle it.

24:15.980 --> 24:16.870
I know what you mean.

24:16.870 --> 24:18.320
You're saying Mr. Sang
paid off those farmers,

24:18.320 --> 24:19.270
and that's why they agreed

24:19.270 --> 24:23.470
-to cooperate with our project, right?
-Yeah. Since you know all that, why…

24:24.300 --> 24:24.890
Ma Li.

24:26.190 --> 24:28.250
Do you know that the farmers' protest

24:29.070 --> 24:31.800
was arranged by Mr. Sang
from the very beginning?

24:57.230 --> 24:58.010
Mr. Liao,

24:58.260 --> 25:00.860
you're here.
Why didn't you call me in advance?

25:01.620 --> 25:02.820
Let's talk in the car.

25:04.560 --> 25:06.490
I'm just about to head to a meeting.

25:37.760 --> 25:39.890
[Information on the Weibo account "0.33"]

25:40.570 --> 25:42.370
Mr. Sang, your acting is superb.

25:42.470 --> 25:44.270
That was a well-executed setup.

25:45.190 --> 25:46.660
[Information on the Weibo account "0.33"]

25:47.190 --> 25:47.830
Mr. Liao,

25:47.860 --> 25:51.120
here's the information
we dug up on the Weibo account 0.33.

26:04.600 --> 26:07.360
Mr. Liao, you're indeed
a veteran businessman—

26:08.150 --> 26:09.270
moving this fast.

26:11.990 --> 26:12.920
What do you mean?

26:16.340 --> 26:17.080
Hello.

26:18.330 --> 26:19.950
I'll be at the airport in an hour.

26:19.950 --> 26:20.750
Help me compile all the cases

26:20.750 --> 26:22.030
from the past 10 years
at Zhizhong Investment

26:22.030 --> 26:23.430
where shareholders

26:23.430 --> 26:26.080
were removed mid-project,

26:26.400 --> 26:27.250
and send them to me.

26:27.250 --> 26:28.730
No problem. Piece of cake.

26:29.190 --> 26:30.790
I'll contact you when I land.

26:40.940 --> 26:41.950
[Summary of Materials]

26:41.980 --> 26:43.230
[on the Mid-Project Removal of Shareholders
in the Zhizhong Investment Project Team]

27:28.960 --> 27:30.930
[Qian Fei]

27:34.170 --> 27:35.870
[Dear passengers, your flight CY3357]

27:35.890 --> 27:36.970
[is expected to depart
in approximately 90 minutes.]

27:36.990 --> 27:38.010
[Please arrange your schedule accordingly]

27:38.040 --> 27:39.850
[to avoid missing your flight.
We wish you a pleasant journey.]

28:41.870 --> 28:42.730
Class Monitor.

28:45.390 --> 28:46.090
Qian Fei?

28:48.150 --> 28:49.280
You're Qian Fei?

28:50.640 --> 28:51.670
Oh my gosh!

28:52.150 --> 28:53.230
Did you get plastic surgery or something?

28:53.230 --> 28:54.530
How did you become t-this gorgeous?

28:54.530 --> 28:55.820
What do you mean, plastic surgery?

28:55.820 --> 28:58.080
Even if I wanted to, I couldn't afford it.

28:59.710 --> 29:01.080
Stop staring at me.

29:01.080 --> 29:01.840
Besides, if I'd really had work done,

29:01.840 --> 29:03.840
you wouldn't be able to tell anyway.

29:05.080 --> 29:06.160
This reunion's

29:06.160 --> 29:07.880
been eye-opening for me.

29:08.250 --> 29:10.030
Everyone's done well for themselves,

29:10.030 --> 29:11.600
especially Wang Ruohai.

29:12.130 --> 29:13.330
But after seeing you,

29:13.700 --> 29:14.760
I can already tell—

29:14.970 --> 29:16.640
you're going to be the biggest surprise

29:16.640 --> 29:17.770
of the night.

29:17.860 --> 29:18.790
No contest.

29:21.660 --> 29:23.940
Don't just stand there.
Come on. We've been waiting for you.

29:23.940 --> 29:24.470
Let's go.

29:28.680 --> 29:29.470
Wait a moment before going in.

29:29.470 --> 29:30.700
Wait here.

29:32.160 --> 29:32.920
Everyone!

29:33.990 --> 29:34.640
Everyone,

29:34.790 --> 29:37.720
open your eyes wide
and take a good look at who's here!

29:39.210 --> 29:40.040
Come in.

29:40.510 --> 29:41.510
Hello, everyone.

29:42.840 --> 29:44.320
Isn't this Qian Fei?

29:44.320 --> 29:45.160
Yes, Qian Fei!

29:45.510 --> 29:46.570
Hello, Professor.

29:47.410 --> 29:48.130
Sit, sit.

29:48.540 --> 29:50.510
I haven't seen her for a long time.

29:53.400 --> 29:55.950
Qian Fei, come on, sit.

29:58.110 --> 29:59.180
So? So?

29:59.880 --> 30:02.640
-Let's eat. Come on.
-Come on, let's dig in.

30:04.340 --> 30:05.550
Come on, let's eat.

30:05.640 --> 30:07.440
Eat up. The food's getting cold.

30:08.530 --> 30:09.770
Well, everyone.

30:10.640 --> 30:11.400
Every year,

30:11.550 --> 30:14.310
seeing all of you again

30:14.890 --> 30:17.700
brings me so much joy.

30:18.120 --> 30:18.800
We only

30:19.150 --> 30:21.720
had one couple in our whole class,

30:22.950 --> 30:24.950
so I hope the two of you

30:25.170 --> 30:26.460
stay together forever.

30:26.460 --> 30:28.190
Professor Zhang, your information
is seriously out of date.

30:28.190 --> 30:29.190
The two of them...

30:29.300 --> 30:31.760
Professor Zhang, you're absolutely right.

30:31.850 --> 30:32.880
Looking back now,

30:33.030 --> 30:34.030
our college days

30:34.360 --> 30:36.330
really were wonderful.

30:38.570 --> 30:39.710
Back then, the love

30:39.960 --> 30:41.150
was just pure love.

30:41.710 --> 30:43.710
As long as you were
looking at the person you loved,

30:43.710 --> 30:45.210
you could do nothing all day

30:45.210 --> 30:47.540
and still smile foolishly the whole time.

30:49.840 --> 30:50.710
Well, Ruohai,

30:50.960 --> 30:52.030
are you trying to be a poet now?

30:52.030 --> 30:53.060
Yeah!

30:54.380 --> 30:55.140
Good! Good!

30:55.480 --> 30:58.310
Well, that reminds me of back then too—

30:58.330 --> 30:59.810
also at our university—

31:00.180 --> 31:01.550
when I met my wife.

31:02.160 --> 31:03.690
She was wearing a red dress,

31:03.840 --> 31:05.640
standing by a tree.

31:06.340 --> 31:09.090
[Wang Ruohai seems kinda weird today.]

31:07.010 --> 31:09.240
At that moment, I remember thinking,

31:10.540 --> 31:12.540
"How could this possibly be winter?

31:12.760 --> 31:14.200
Spring has arrived."

31:16.630 --> 31:17.980
Spring has arrived.

31:18.000 --> 31:19.870
M-My biggest regret

31:20.030 --> 31:20.840
about my college years

31:20.840 --> 31:23.120
is never having had
a passionate, all-out romance.

31:23.120 --> 31:24.780
So, to make up for that regret,

31:24.790 --> 31:26.620
I've decided to marry a classmate.

31:25.060 --> 31:25.730
[That bastard didn't
do anything to you, did he?]

31:25.760 --> 31:26.440
[No, he didn't. It's just…]

31:26.470 --> 31:27.490
[Anyway, he seems to regret it
and wants to get back together.]

31:27.880 --> 31:28.510
Mei!

31:29.800 --> 31:32.030
We're going to relive our youth together!

31:32.030 --> 31:33.190
They are getting married?

31:33.190 --> 31:34.490
You even kept it a secret from us, huh?

31:34.490 --> 31:35.460
You hid it so well.

31:35.460 --> 31:36.360
You really hid it well.

31:36.360 --> 31:38.270
W-We'd like to toast everyone.

31:38.970 --> 31:39.630
Come on.

31:39.660 --> 31:40.030
Come on.

31:40.030 --> 31:40.850
Congratulations.

31:40.850 --> 31:42.850
To our friendship—cheers!

31:42.920 --> 31:44.060
Cheers!

31:44.080 --> 31:45.010
Come on, come on.

31:51.380 --> 31:52.840
Don't drink too much. Sit.

31:53.350 --> 31:54.380
Fei.

31:54.610 --> 31:57.340
Is there really no chance
for you and Wang Ruohai?

31:57.560 --> 31:58.420
I can see Wang Ruohai

31:58.420 --> 32:00.050
looking at you so affectionately.

32:00.050 --> 32:02.030
He's clearly trying to
get back together with you.

32:02.030 --> 32:03.300
Impossible.

32:03.320 --> 32:04.560
Look at Mr. Wang now,

32:04.590 --> 32:05.830
-he's way out of my league.
-Well, Ruohai,

32:05.830 --> 32:07.290
you're doing the best out of all of us.

32:07.290 --> 32:08.920
I heard that

32:09.430 --> 32:11.940
after he broke up with that rich girl,

32:11.960 --> 32:14.220
he landed a job at an even bigger company.

32:14.770 --> 32:17.350
He's even paying for tonight's dinner.

32:21.320 --> 32:22.800
Mei, Mei.

32:23.050 --> 32:24.580
Let's toast to our teacher.

32:28.230 --> 32:31.230
Professor Zhang
really took good care of us back then.

32:35.540 --> 32:36.270
Come on, cheers.

32:36.270 --> 32:37.300
Raise your glasses!

32:37.300 --> 32:38.450
I remember this

32:39.340 --> 32:40.740
used to be your favorite.

32:42.040 --> 32:42.840
Thank you.

32:43.410 --> 32:45.140
I heard you're treating today.

32:45.620 --> 32:47.480
Seeing how lavish this spread is,

32:47.670 --> 32:49.270
things really have changed.

32:49.960 --> 32:50.830
No, no.

32:52.160 --> 32:53.910
It's just that, thinking back,

32:54.210 --> 32:55.130
I never took you

32:56.660 --> 32:58.720
to eat anything good back in college.

32:59.440 --> 33:01.770
I-I originally wanted to treat you alone,

33:03.060 --> 33:04.900
but I figured you wouldn't come.

33:04.970 --> 33:07.730
So, thanks to our classmates today,

33:08.950 --> 33:10.880
I finally got the chance to see you.

33:11.730 --> 33:13.280
Then you really were overthinking it.

33:13.280 --> 33:14.540
Don't do this again.

33:16.660 --> 33:17.730
Come on, everyone,

33:17.900 --> 33:19.700
I've created a group chat for us.

33:19.740 --> 33:21.290
Everyone, send your phone numbers there.

33:21.290 --> 33:23.990
Now we all use WeChat
and rarely call each other anymore.

33:23.990 --> 33:24.670
If someone's WeChat account
ever gets lost,

33:24.670 --> 33:25.710
we won't be able to reach them, right?

33:25.710 --> 33:27.120
Please pass me my phone.

33:28.070 --> 33:31.000
I just sent a red package in the group chat.
Go grab it!

33:32.560 --> 33:35.360
Whoever gets the biggest one
sends the next round.

33:35.900 --> 33:37.800
[Has everyone shared their phone number?]

33:37.820 --> 33:39.790
[Wang Ruohai]

33:41.510 --> 33:43.350
[Wang Ruohai]

33:50.260 --> 33:50.580
[Blocked Contacts]

33:51.400 --> 33:52.900
[Blocked Contacts]

33:54.640 --> 33:55.970
It really is God's will.

33:56.170 --> 33:58.240
Even my phone couldn't stand Wang Ruohai

33:58.240 --> 34:00.300
and automatically blacklisted him.

34:05.460 --> 34:07.060
Why did you blacklist me?

34:07.080 --> 34:09.260
Before, too many unimportant people
and things

34:09.260 --> 34:10.120
took up my time.

34:10.630 --> 34:12.630
Now I just want to clear them all out.

34:13.230 --> 34:15.030
So you don't even want to keep in touch?

34:15.030 --> 34:16.250
Even just as friends?

34:18.449 --> 34:20.179
I don't even want to be friends.

34:22.750 --> 34:23.610
I asked around.

34:24.270 --> 34:25.370
I know you're single now.

34:25.370 --> 34:26.719
That's why I went to all the trouble

34:26.719 --> 34:28.210
of organizing today's reunion.

34:28.210 --> 34:30.280
I'd already prepared myself for the worst.

34:30.280 --> 34:31.110
I just want to make it up to you.

34:31.110 --> 34:32.030
Don't bother.

34:33.320 --> 34:34.199
Look,

34:34.320 --> 34:36.250
aren't we both doing just fine now?

34:36.889 --> 34:37.880
To be honest,

34:38.030 --> 34:39.199
if it were the old me,

34:39.780 --> 34:42.730
I'd still want you
to feel guilty for the rest of your life.

34:42.730 --> 34:43.690
But now,

34:44.150 --> 34:45.639
I just want

34:45.670 --> 34:47.929
to be completely erased from your world.

34:52.500 --> 34:54.060
Before, when I had nothing,

34:55.280 --> 34:57.080
I thought the other half I needed

34:57.310 --> 34:59.850
was someone who could understand me,
be considerate of me,

34:59.850 --> 35:01.680
and even help me with my career.

35:02.080 --> 35:03.280
But now I've realized

35:04.060 --> 35:05.660
none of that really matters.

35:07.470 --> 35:10.600
What I truly want is someone
to share life's joys and hardships with.

35:10.600 --> 35:12.090
Being with someone I love

35:13.090 --> 35:14.950
matters more than anything else.

35:43.450 --> 35:45.110
Should I call my landlady?

35:46.840 --> 35:48.250
Is she asleep or not?

35:49.440 --> 35:50.550
It's been so many days.

35:50.550 --> 35:52.150
Why hasn't she contacted me?

35:52.950 --> 35:54.610
Why is she so stubborn?

35:55.480 --> 35:56.430
Is she mad at me,

35:56.430 --> 35:59.030
or has she simply
never thought about me at all?

36:38.210 --> 36:40.270
[Job Openings]

36:38.920 --> 36:40.500
I've finished my resume,

36:40.530 --> 36:42.560
but there isn't a single job
I want to apply for.

36:42.560 --> 36:43.860
It hasn't been that long.

36:43.860 --> 36:46.550
Taking a month or two
to find a job is perfectly normal.

36:46.550 --> 36:47.320
Take it easy.

36:47.880 --> 36:49.240
I used to be anxious

36:49.260 --> 36:51.320
because I had a mortgage to pay
and debts to clear.

36:51.320 --> 36:53.580
Now I'm anxious because I want to find out

36:53.590 --> 36:55.370
if there's actually a job out there,

36:55.370 --> 36:57.830
purely in finance,
that I'd genuinely like.

36:57.860 --> 37:00.300
Why don't you ask your tenant?

37:00.550 --> 37:02.350
He's in the same industry as you,

37:02.900 --> 37:04.510
and he has a lot of connections.

37:04.510 --> 37:05.710
Maybe he can help you.

37:07.090 --> 37:07.820
That's true.

37:08.880 --> 37:09.610
I'll ask him.

37:12.440 --> 37:14.360
[Pretentious Li]

37:13.680 --> 37:15.110
Our current equity structure

37:14.580 --> 37:17.860
[Fulaxida Equity Distribution]

37:15.130 --> 37:16.150
is still fairly well balanced.

37:16.150 --> 37:17.030
I have 34%,

37:17.050 --> 37:18.080
and you have 33%.

37:18.400 --> 37:19.590
Together,

37:19.590 --> 37:21.110
that's 67%,

37:21.110 --> 37:22.470
over the majority control threshold.

37:22.470 --> 37:23.570
What does that mean?

37:23.570 --> 37:24.770
It means we have complete authority

37:23.710 --> 37:25.740
[Fulaxida Equity Distribution]

37:24.800 --> 37:26.040
over major decisions

37:26.280 --> 37:28.470
like amending the company charter,
splitting or merging the company,

37:28.470 --> 37:29.630
changing business scope, and so on.

37:29.630 --> 37:30.670
But

37:30.840 --> 37:32.200
if we dilute our equity,

37:32.240 --> 37:33.710
even by just 1%—

37:33.760 --> 37:34.720
say,

37:34.120 --> 37:35.810
[Fulaxida Equity Distribution]

37:34.720 --> 37:35.990
down to 66%—

37:36.630 --> 37:39.160
we'd lose absolute control
and fall into relative control,

37:39.160 --> 37:40.860
where the threshold is just 51%.

37:40.860 --> 37:43.390
Past that point,
any major company decisions

37:43.550 --> 37:45.800
would need shareholder approval.

37:48.830 --> 37:49.650
Got it?

37:50.360 --> 37:51.490
Let it sink in first.

37:56.350 --> 37:58.370
[When will you be back
from your business trip?]

38:05.650 --> 38:06.980
I can't take it anymore.

38:07.090 --> 38:08.690
My brain's about to explode.

38:10.270 --> 38:10.930
[Don't know yet.]

38:13.430 --> 38:16.880
The business world is like a battlefield—
that's just how it is.

38:16.880 --> 38:18.140
Memorize it. Hurry up.

38:19.430 --> 38:20.790
[Don't know yet.]

38:21.450 --> 38:22.960
My fault. It's my fault.

38:23.280 --> 38:25.200
I shouldn't have given you
that stupid advice.

38:25.200 --> 38:27.110
I just shouldn't have contacted him first.

38:27.110 --> 38:28.260
At this point,

38:28.280 --> 38:30.680
if I still can't tell
he's been avoiding me,

38:30.720 --> 38:32.250
then I really must be blind.

38:39.430 --> 38:42.430
Majority control threshold, 67%.

38:48.020 --> 38:49.470
What about 51%?

38:50.510 --> 38:52.280
51% is...

38:53.400 --> 38:54.660
Don't look over there.

38:58.590 --> 39:00.190
I think I should just go farm.

39:06.030 --> 39:06.800
I'm tired.

39:11.720 --> 39:13.720
You haven't recovered from gastroenteritis.
Go rest.

39:13.720 --> 39:14.740
I'll do it in a bit.

39:15.280 --> 39:16.550
I've been fine for ages.

39:16.550 --> 39:18.880
Didn't I help her with the birthday event?

39:20.030 --> 39:21.650
These notebooks are new as well.

39:21.650 --> 39:23.050
Send them to the kids too?

39:23.210 --> 39:24.540
And these clothes,

39:24.570 --> 39:25.510
along with that old computer.

39:25.510 --> 39:26.760
Pack them all up and send them.

39:26.760 --> 39:27.920
Xin You said

39:27.920 --> 39:29.990
the kids over there
really need these things.

39:29.990 --> 39:30.780
Okay.

39:33.460 --> 39:35.440
Then let's send this batch first.

39:35.630 --> 39:37.130
Later, we can ask our friends

39:37.130 --> 39:38.880
and coworkers to donate as well.

39:38.880 --> 39:41.150
We should be able to gather another batch.

39:41.150 --> 39:44.550
I alone can rally enough donations
to fill several truckloads.

39:44.550 --> 39:46.800
Yeah, you're the best at that.

39:47.630 --> 39:48.280
Of course.

39:49.030 --> 39:51.160
Anyway, there's strength in numbers.

39:51.250 --> 39:52.980
So, how's your exam prep going?

39:56.030 --> 39:57.630
I already listed all my exam prep books

39:57.630 --> 39:58.880
on Goofish.

40:00.200 --> 40:00.840
Why?

40:02.110 --> 40:04.110
You're not taking the exam anymore?

40:06.400 --> 40:08.470
I thought you were seriously
preparing for it since you quit your job.

40:08.470 --> 40:09.630
That's why I never asked.

40:09.630 --> 40:11.240
How could you just decide not to take it?

40:11.240 --> 40:12.030
See?

40:12.360 --> 40:14.510
I told you she'd react exactly like this.

40:14.510 --> 40:15.570
You knew all along?

40:17.650 --> 40:19.190
You guys really don't need to worry.

40:19.190 --> 40:21.390
It's a registration-based system now.

40:21.680 --> 40:22.470
In the past,

40:22.470 --> 40:24.110
any sponsor
could make over a million a year

40:24.110 --> 40:25.090
and rake in huge signing fees.

40:25.090 --> 40:26.200
Things are different now.

40:26.200 --> 40:27.070
Besides passing the exam,

40:27.070 --> 40:29.240
you can also get directly recommended
by an investment bank.

40:29.240 --> 40:30.470
You mean,

40:30.470 --> 40:31.800
once you join a new company,

40:31.800 --> 40:34.060
you'll have them recommend you instead?

40:35.710 --> 40:36.870
That's one option.

40:37.630 --> 40:39.300
But you really need to think it through.

40:39.300 --> 40:41.110
This kind of job isn't something
you can just find whenever you want.

40:41.110 --> 40:42.310
You've tried before.

40:43.030 --> 40:45.360
I can give you a research report
or something,

40:45.360 --> 40:47.880
but beyond that, I can't really help you
with other companies.

40:47.880 --> 40:48.610
Don't worry.

40:49.030 --> 40:51.450
This time, I'm fully prepared.

40:53.400 --> 40:54.660
The kid's all grown up.

40:55.430 --> 40:57.490
As long as you've thought it through.

40:59.450 --> 41:01.070
I still have a part-time job at the mall.

41:01.070 --> 41:03.560
This is almost done. You guys keep at it.
Gotta go.

41:03.560 --> 41:05.090
Your time management is...

41:05.470 --> 41:06.400
Hold on, hold on.

41:06.550 --> 41:06.920
What?

41:06.920 --> 41:08.780
Take the trash out on your way out.

41:10.360 --> 41:11.240
Remember to eat!

41:11.240 --> 41:12.280
-Okay.
-Your stomach isn't very good.

41:12.280 --> 41:13.470
I'll ask around for you on my way.

41:13.470 --> 41:14.550
Okay, okay, bye.

41:14.550 --> 41:16.150
Bye, be careful on your way.

41:19.020 --> 41:21.210
I didn't realize I had so many clothes.

41:22.320 --> 41:22.920
Let me see.

41:23.440 --> 41:24.320
When you get the chance,

41:24.320 --> 41:26.800
just pack up the clothes and shoes
you don't need

41:26.800 --> 41:28.510
and send them to me.

41:30.550 --> 41:31.800
Okay, hanging up.

41:33.430 --> 41:34.200
Dang.

41:34.920 --> 41:35.590
Auntie.

41:37.400 --> 41:38.990
We bumped into each other again.

41:38.990 --> 41:40.650
We really have a special bond.

41:40.990 --> 41:42.680
H-How's your stomach now?

41:42.950 --> 41:44.480
Are you feeling any better?

41:44.880 --> 41:47.610
With a body like mine,
I've long since recovered.

41:48.070 --> 41:48.840
Um...

41:49.920 --> 41:51.950
Our program won first prize.

41:52.230 --> 41:53.930
Did Jun tell you?

41:54.110 --> 41:54.990
He told me.

41:55.330 --> 41:57.260
I have to say, that day, I really...

41:58.110 --> 41:59.840
I really admired you.

42:00.110 --> 42:01.240
You were so sick,

42:01.240 --> 42:04.570
yet you still gave it everything you had.
It was so touching.

42:05.470 --> 42:06.990
I'm part of the team too.

42:07.400 --> 42:08.150
I couldn't let my condition

42:08.150 --> 42:10.010
affect you or the rest of the team.

42:10.360 --> 42:11.430
And I certainly couldn't let

42:11.430 --> 42:13.510
all the months Jun put into
preparing for the dance competition

42:13.510 --> 42:14.880
go unrewarded.

42:17.100 --> 42:19.790
That last part is
the most important, right?

42:20.670 --> 42:23.270
That's
what mattered most to you too, isn't it?

42:23.990 --> 42:25.230
You girl.

42:25.540 --> 42:27.540
Well, I'd better get going, Auntie.

42:30.090 --> 42:32.970
Come over when you have time.

42:33.000 --> 42:35.600
I'll make you
those shepherd's purse wontons.

42:35.630 --> 42:37.160
They're really delicious.

42:37.170 --> 42:38.800
Okay. I'll definitely come
and try them sometime.

42:38.800 --> 42:39.470
Okay.

42:39.470 --> 42:40.470
Goodbye, Auntie.

42:52.070 --> 42:53.660
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:55.470 --> 42:57.110
What exactly do you want, Wang Ruohai?

42:56.180 --> 42:58.500
[Let's start over. Wang Ruohai]

42:57.630 --> 42:58.280
I just want you

42:58.280 --> 42:59.550
to unblock me.

42:59.960 --> 43:01.160
Looks like it worked.

43:02.150 --> 43:04.680
I had dinner
with some business partners yesterday

43:04.680 --> 43:06.210
and drank a little too much,

43:06.360 --> 43:08.020
so I didn't hear my phone ring.

43:08.400 --> 43:09.990
I just wanted to use this trip

43:09.990 --> 43:12.590
to really sort out
my thoughts once and for all.

43:12.800 --> 43:13.350
Look at me.

43:13.350 --> 43:14.340
Right now,

43:14.530 --> 43:15.090
tell me,

43:15.400 --> 43:16.490
how do you feel?

43:16.900 --> 43:18.710
All I ever think about is seeing her.
